abstract: >
  A multi-agent framework for automated computer science paper reading,
  methodology analysis, and reproduction, featuring six specialized agents,
  MCP protocol integration, a three-tier memory system, and a knowledge
  graph engine.
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - paper-reading
  - multi-agent
  - large-language-models
  - scientific-computing
  - code-generation
  - knowledge-graph
